What the licence above covers

The MIT licence applies to the source code only: everything under src/ and
scripts/, and the configuration files at the root of this repository.

It does not cover the following, which keep their own terms:

- Written content, the CV, the case studies and the site's visual design:
  Copyright (c) 2026 Madalitso Daka. All rights reserved.
- Dashly screenshots (public/dashly/): Copyright (c) Dashly Software.
  All rights reserved.
- Statue images made from the Marcus Aurelius scan (public/statue/marcus.png,
  public/marginalia/, public/og.png): derived from a 3D scan by Rama,
  Wikimedia Commons, licensed CC BY-SA 3.0 FR, and shared under that licence.
- The other statue images (public/statue/): made from scans in the SMK Royal
  Cast Collection, public domain.
- Quotations from the Meditations: George Long's 1862 translation, public
  domain.
- Typefaces: loaded through next/font, each under the SIL Open Font License.
